readme.text:
- it registers the bundled **`cordis-plugin-development`** skill globally, so the agent can follow a guided design → prototype → implement → validate → package → install workflow;
- it adds a **Settings → Plugins → workshop** tab where you describe what you want in one box and pick an engine (Claude Code mode, Cordis mode, or standard mode); the tab opens a dedicated session with the skill prompt pre-filled instead of hijacking your current conversation;
- it ships the **scaffolding and validation toolkit** the skill calls: `inspect-target.mjs` (read the real host versions), `scaffold-package.mjs` (generate a buildable package), `validate-package.mjs` (check the package contract), plus the prototype contract and validation matrix references.
